	(property "Description" "The joystick module (Alpsalpine-ffc-pogo) on 4 mm: four M2 standoffs and screws, or M2 locating pins at the PIN corners (on 4 mm spacers) and a 4 x 2 mm disc magnet pair at each MAG corner (north up on this board), the magnets 4 mm together. No 3D model of the module here: the config's assemblies place it as a part of its own (ErgoCai.modules joystick/Alpsalpine-ffc-pogo/Alpsalpine-ffc-pogo.glb)"
